### Create Mary
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Mary",
  "lastName": "Smith",
  "email": "mary@example.com",
  "age": 22,
  "course": "Information Systems"
}

### Create John
POST http://localhost:8080/api/students
